      "content": "i guess i never thought of it that way. like, is there actually a kind of peace in just not being there to see the very last piece fall? it sounds almost... easier to just go while there's still a shred of something beautiful left, instead of waiting for the total darkness. do you think there's a certain grace in leaving early like that?",
